  "score_policy": "Display original definitive Brier unchanged and, separately, a headline on fully matured windows. Publish missingness, voids, per-contract best/worst Brier bounds and an abstention-at-0.5 sensitivity. Never pool protocol versions or horizons.",
  "no_policy": "For new adjudications cross-check open_claim_ids against source-dated candidate cases/evidence and forecast-specific reviews. A generic closed case is not proof of nonqualification; every relevant_found item in a negative closure needs an explicit exclusion.",
